key   i008_tc             int     -       "I021/008/TC: Target Trajectory Change Report Capability (Aircraft Operational Status). 0 = No capability for Trajectory Change Reports, 1 = Support for TC+0 reports only, 2 = Support for multiple TC reports, 3 = Reserved"
